[PrintTextModified Text:樱羽艾玛大喊着，爬起身来。|#0101Adv02_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:大概是因为做了噩梦，她的呼吸相当紊乱，<br>而且满身都是汗水。|#0101Adv02_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:原来是做梦。她才刚安下心来——<br>眼前的光景就逐渐清晰了起来。|#0101Adv02_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_21_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:咦，怎么回事，这里是……？|#0101Adv02_Ema002| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Rotation:,,0 Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Duration:0 Lazy:false ScenePosition:50,50 AppearanceAndTransition:490_1
@ResetText
@HideActors ActorIds:Stills-Middle Duration:0.6 Lazy:false
@Wait WaitMode:0.8

[PrintTextModified Text:醒来的艾玛发现，这里不是她自己的房间。<br>这是张做工粗糙的双层床，她睡在了这里的下铺。|#0101Adv02_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:床紧贴着老旧的石墙，<br>而石墙似乎透着一股寒气，总令人不禁为之一颤。|#0101Adv02_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:室内光线昏暗，空气也并不畅通。<br>并且——有一道铁栅栏限制了自由。|#0101Adv02_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@EmoteShake ActorIds:Stills Loop:false

[PrintTextModified Text:牢、牢房……！？为什么！？|#0101Adv02_Ema003| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛陷入了恐慌，<br>拼命回想着睡前的记忆。|#0101Adv02_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（昨天是想到明天我就要上高中了……<br>　很开心地睡着了才对）|#0101Adv02_Ema004|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:昨天是春假的最后一天。|#0101Adv02_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛早早地洗了澡，换了睡衣，<br>早早地钻进了被窝里。|#0101Adv02_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（记得睡觉前……我还看着挂在墙上的<br>　全新的高中制服）|#0101Adv02_Ema005|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:望着那件明天就要穿上的制服，<br>艾玛露出了十分幸福的笑容。|#0101Adv02_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（还下了决心，一切要重新开始……）|#0101Adv02_Ema006| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:然后在温暖的被窝包裹下，闭上了双眼。|#0101Adv02_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:可是现在，她正被关在牢房里。<br>身上还穿着自己从没见过的衣服。|#0101Adv02_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（这是噩梦的后续……？）|#0101Adv02_Ema007| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:但，四周的一切却如此真实。|#0101Adv02_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她大致观察了下室内。四周被结实的石墙包围，<br>只有铁栅栏一面联通着过道。|#0101Adv02_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:墙上安装有电视屏幕。|#0101Adv02_Narrative015| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:在透着中世纪气息的古牢里面，<br>这块现代随处可见的显示屏幕实在是格格不入。|#0101Adv02_Narrative016| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ========================================
; [hideStill]
; ========================================

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:1_1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:我说，这里究竟是什么地方！？|#0101Adv02_Ema008| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛抓着铁栅栏，喊出声来。|#0101Adv02_Narrative017| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:紧接着，远远地从其他地方传来了<br>其他少女们的叫喊声。|#0101Adv02_Narrative018| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

; ＠遠野ハンナ
[PrintTextModified Text:竟把本小姐关在这种地方！<br>究竟是什么意思啊！？|#0101Adv02_Unknown001| AuthorId:Unknown RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ＠佐伯ミリア
[PrintTextModified Text:监禁少女可是犯罪欸！虽然不知是谁，<br>可干出来这种事，这辈子就到头了欸！？|#0101Adv02_Unknown002| AuthorId:Unknown RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ＠紫藤アリサ
[PrintTextModified Text:喂，开什么玩笑，我要杀了你！放我出去！！|#0101Adv02_Unknown003| AuthorId:Unknown RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:"（……太好了，被关进来的<br>　不止我一个人）|#0101Adv02_Ema009|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:现场忽然吵闹起来，<br>艾玛的脸上露出了安心。紧接着——|#0101Adv02_Narrative019| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

; ＠二階堂ヒロ
[PrintTextModified Text:——能不能给我安静一下？|#0101Adv02_Unknown004| AuthorId:Unknown RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:从艾玛身后冷不防传来一道清冽的声音。|#0101Adv02_Narrative020| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_1 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛顺着声音望去，<br>发现双层床的上铺有个刚起身的人。|#0101Adv02_Narrative021| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Angry1

; ＠二階堂ヒロ
[PrintTextModified Text:大吵大闹是不对的。|#0101Adv02_Unknown005| AuthorId:Unknown RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; 息を呑む
[PrintTextModified Text:——！！|#0101Adv02_Ema010| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛十分吃惊，瞬间忘记了呼吸。<br>因为，她认识这位说话的少女。|#0101Adv02_Narrative022| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（真的假的……<br>　是二阶堂希罗……？）|#0101Adv02_Ema011|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:二阶堂希罗——|#0101Adv02_Narrative023| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:是在艾玛的初中时代，令她深陷黑暗的同窗，<br>也是广受众人仰慕，常在人群中心可爱地微笑着的少女……|#0101Adv02_Narrative024| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:和她对上眼的希罗，也大大的瞪圆了眼睛。<br>艾玛还是第一次见有人把眼睛瞪得那么大。|#0101Adv02_Narrative025| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:为什么你会在这里？|#0101Adv02_Hiro001| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_178 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:希罗轻快地爬下了床，向艾玛问道。|#0101Adv02_Narrative026| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:往日同窗竟出现在眼前，<br>惊慌失措的艾玛哑口无言。|#0101Adv02_Narrative027| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Surprised1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Fearful1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:啊……|#0101Adv02_Ema012| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这是哪里？|#0101Adv02_Hiro002| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:希罗四下张望着，<br>紧张地尖声问道。|#0101Adv02_Narrative028| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我、我说，希罗……|#0101Adv02_Ema013| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛鼓起勇气，<br>尝试向往日旧识搭话。|#0101Adv02_Narrative029| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:这时——|#0101Adv02_Narrative030| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_3 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:声音从墙壁上的显示屏幕传来。<br>艾玛和希罗吓了一跳，然后望向屏幕。|#0101Adv02_Narrative031| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

