[PrintTextModified Text:（欸，怎么回事！？猫、猫头鹰怪物……！？）|#0101Adv02_Ema014| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ＠備考◆配信中
[PrintTextModified Text:啊……喂喂……看得见画面吗……？<br>毕竟机器有好些年头了，故障特别多……唉呀呀。|#0101Adv02_Warden001| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ＠備考◆配信中
[PrintTextModified Text:大家好，我是典狱长。|#0101Adv02_Warden002| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ＠備考◆配信中
[PrintTextModified Text:我想给大家作详细说明，<br>请各位到会客厅来集合。|#0101Adv02_Warden003| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ＠備考◆配信中
[PrintTextModified Text:我会给大家打开牢房的锁，<br>之后请大家跟着带路的看守。|#0101Adv02_Warden004| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ＠備考◆配信中
[PrintTextModified Text:想反抗也没问题……<br>只不过小命不保罢了……嗯……|#0101Adv02_Warden005| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

