[PrintTextModified Text:典狱长……？看守……？|#0101Adv02_Ema015| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛似乎思考不太跟得上状况的变化，呆站在原地一动不动——<br>而她身边的希罗也一样。紧接着——|#0101Adv02_Narrative033| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_5 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:从铁栅栏的另一侧——过道处，<br>传来了某样沉重物体的移动声，且愈来愈接近。|#0101Adv02_Narrative034| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:那声音透着一股令人汗毛直竖的感觉，<br>令艾玛她们本能地察觉到了危险。|#0101Adv02_Narrative035| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛和希罗绷紧了身子，<br>——然后缓慢地将视线挪动到过道上。|#0101Adv02_Narrative036| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

