; ＠沢渡ココ

[PrintTextModified Text:呀啊啊啊！怪物别碰我！好恶心！<br>好了，好了啦，我走就是！！|#0101Adv02_Unknown006| AuthorId:Unknown RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛她们听见，其他牢房里<br>有人被怪物强行带走了。|#0101Adv02_Narrative041| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这让她们两个感到越来越害怕了。|#0101Adv02_Narrative042| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Rotation:,,0 Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Duration:0 Lazy:false ScenePosition:50,50 AppearanceAndTransition:1_1 SubId:Default
