@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:60 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Fearful1,ArmR1

[PrintTextModified Text:所谓的说明，会解释清楚情况吗。<br>那我得快点过去……|#0101Adv02_Hiro003| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:希罗自言自语着，然后望向身旁的艾玛。|#0101Adv02_Narrative043| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这时她终于发现，<br>艾玛紧紧抓住了她的手臂。|#0101Adv02_Narrative044| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_18 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:40 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Angry2
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Fearful1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:——唰。<br>她用力地甩开了艾玛的手。|#0101Adv02_Narrative045| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……！|#0101Adv02_Ema018| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不要随便碰我。<br>你可别忘了，我讨厌你。|#0101Adv02_Hiro004| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideActors ActorIds:Hiro Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:希罗的眼神中<br>透着一股深深的厌弃。|#0101Adv02_Narrative046| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

